event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":84,"item_id":"rs_029384243a3da871016aca531406c881969360581b3f118d89","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test sequence adjustments**\n\nI’m pondering whether I have enough time to extend the tests before toggling things. Should I add a rename option after completing the current state? It might be necessary to archive older expectations since they could change. I want to avoid simply adding something at the end. It feels better to ensure the full sequence is completed before setting everything again. So, I’ll really need to think this through carefully!"}

